<div class="aboutProjectSection1024">
            <h1>Antivirus App</h1>
            <div class="sectionText">
                <h4>About the project</h4>
                <span>A comprehensive desktop application that combines many tools and utilities in one product: antivirus scanning, registry cleanup, vulnerability checks, tamper protection, startup management, and more.</span>
                <span>The main challenge was bringing many related utilities into a single interface. Special attention went to the scan and auto-fix screen, the core tool of the product. Issues were grouped into subcategories, and each group could be expanded to inspect individual vulnerabilities. I also prepared icons for every vulnerability type and group.</span>
                <span>We used interactive prototypes throughout the project. With this many connected features, prototypes helped us test links between screens and keep the overall logic coherent.</span>
                <span>A UI kit was prepared as well. The interface was assembled with an atomic approach, using MS Windows libraries as a base and customizing them where the product needed it.</span>
            </div>
